# Describe the bug
When the UPF receives a PFCP Association Setup Request missing the Recovery Time Stamp IE, it causes handleAssociationSetupRequest to dereference a nil IE through IE.RecoveryTimeStamp(), triggering a panic and crashing the UPF, and leading to a DoS.

# Release Information
Component: UPF (pfcpiface)
Version: upf-epc-pfcpiface:2.1.3-dev

